OL,3,ARadiation link in flight attendant's
OL,4,Abreast cancer, French court finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FA French court has for the first time
OL,7,Frecognised cosmic radiation as a factor
OL,8,Fin the breast cancer of a long-serving
OL,9,Fflight attendant.
OL,11,FSophie Lainault, a 59 year-old former
OL,12,Fstewardess on Air France, sought to
OL,13,Fhave her cancer recognised as an
OL,14,Foccupational disease, brought on by
OL,15,Fconditions at work.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
