OL,3,ARadiation link in flight attendant's
OL,4,Abreast cancer, French court finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis has now been confirmed in a
OL,7,Flandmark court ruling in the
OL,8,Fsouthwestern town of Bayonne, which
OL,9,Fsaid that cosmic radiation was one of
OL,10,Fthree carcinogenic hazards arising from
OL,11,Fher profession. The other two were
OL,12,Fpassive smoking and prolonged night
OL,13,Fwork.
OL,15,FSmoking was authorised on Air France
OL,16,Fflights until 2000.
